      "roundness": null,
      "text": "the process stopped or was lost mid-attempt:\nnever retried, never dispatched again\na recovery report is written, the policy decides:\nmanual (default): run waits in needs_recovery\nahp recover <attempt> --policy adopt | abort\nadopt verifies the workspace; abort fails the step\nin evaluation: a harness incident",
